WEBVTT

01:49.539 --> 01:54.940
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.030 --> 01:57.910
[Episode 21]

01:58.000 --> 01:58.710
I know that

01:58.710 --> 01:59.759
this method of weapon forging

01:59.759 --> 02:00.870
involves your identity as a prince

02:00.870 --> 02:01.740
and must not be leaked.

02:01.740 --> 02:03.240
But she's a young lady after all,

02:03.240 --> 02:04.570
and such a good one at that.

02:04.570 --> 02:05.650
Do you really expect me to torture her

02:05.650 --> 02:06.680
or silence her by killing?

02:06.680 --> 02:07.230
What I meant is that...

02:07.230 --> 02:07.870
No, don't talk yet.

02:07.870 --> 02:08.639
Listen to me.

02:08.660 --> 02:09.789
You know who Song Yiting is.

02:09.789 --> 02:11.330
Song Yiting is Song Yimeng's
younger sister.

02:11.330 --> 02:12.630
If Song Yimeng's sister dies,

02:12.630 --> 02:13.710
do you think she won't investigate?

02:13.710 --> 02:15.310
And do you think she won't find out
it's you, Li Shiliu, behind it?

02:15.310 --> 02:15.710
I...

02:15.710 --> 02:17.470
So I think the top priority now

02:17.470 --> 02:18.730
is to get the blade back

02:18.730 --> 02:20.130
instead of assigning blame.

02:20.130 --> 02:22.400
Tomorrow is the last day of the
three-day deadline.

02:22.400 --> 02:25.930
Do you really have to get someone killed
at this critical point?

02:31.640 --> 02:32.430
Are you done?

02:35.670 --> 02:37.200
When did I ever say

02:37.880 --> 02:39.510
I wanted to kill Song Yiting?

02:40.840 --> 02:41.780
Or in your eyes,

02:41.810 --> 02:43.270
am I just someone who takes lives lightly,

02:43.270 --> 02:44.220
commits all kinds of evil,

02:44.220 --> 02:45.550
and is beyond redemption?

02:45.550 --> 02:46.320
No, it's just

02:46.350 --> 02:47.610
I've heard Song Yimeng say those things
about you

02:47.610 --> 02:48.430
so many times that I got influenced.

02:48.430 --> 02:49.829
That's not what I meant.

02:51.980 --> 02:53.000
Let me tell you,

02:53.640 --> 02:55.050
I'll be blunt upfront.

02:55.440 --> 02:56.410
If you get the blade back

02:56.410 --> 02:57.740
and handle the aftermath properly,

02:57.740 --> 02:59.540
we can put this matter behind us.

02:59.750 --> 03:01.610
But if you can't get the blade back

03:01.940 --> 03:03.730
and cause me any more trouble,

03:05.300 --> 03:07.410
I won't lay a hand on Song Yiting,

03:08.060 --> 03:10.500
but I make no promises about
not dealing with you.

03:10.500 --> 03:11.500
Understand?

03:12.040 --> 03:13.010
I understand.

03:13.030 --> 03:14.240
You can get me out of jail,

03:14.240 --> 03:15.770
and you can throw me back in.

03:15.940 --> 03:16.870
Don't worry.

03:16.870 --> 03:18.100
I've already angered her today.

03:18.100 --> 03:19.910
I won't go see her tomorrow, either.

03:19.910 --> 03:21.150
The moment the three-day deadline is up,

03:21.150 --> 03:21.910
I'll go collect it immediately.

03:21.910 --> 03:22.900
Why wait for three days?

03:22.900 --> 03:23.780
Go tomorrow.

03:29.540 --> 03:30.510
Understood.

03:40.780 --> 03:42.380
Wait, since when did you

03:42.730 --> 03:45.320
start caring so much about a woman?

03:45.430 --> 03:46.220
I... I...

03:48.150 --> 03:49.130
I...

03:50.060 --> 03:52.060
You're not in love with her, are you?

03:52.670 --> 03:54.070
Of... Of course not.

03:58.660 --> 03:59.790
That's for the best.

04:01.890 --> 04:03.310
As your older brother,

04:03.780 --> 04:05.240
let me tell you something.

04:05.330 --> 04:07.000
This is the folly of love...

04:07.020 --> 04:08.640
The weakness of heroes.

04:11.380 --> 04:12.840
Good that you understand.

04:15.820 --> 04:17.300
But for a worthless man like me,

04:17.300 --> 04:18.700
my spirit's even weaker.

04:36.659 --> 04:37.680
My Lady.

04:37.740 --> 04:38.820
Please take a rest.

04:40.340 --> 04:42.470
No matter how many paintings you make,

04:42.950 --> 04:45.240
you can't change Mr. Li's mind.

04:47.220 --> 04:48.740
I'm not painting these

04:48.950 --> 04:50.220
for him,

04:51.180 --> 04:52.930
but to remind myself

04:53.860 --> 04:55.150
how foolish I've been.

04:56.409 --> 04:58.870
I thought if I put my sincere heart
out there,

04:59.270 --> 05:01.470
it would definitely lead to something.

05:06.790 --> 05:09.020
The way he saved me that day

05:09.860 --> 05:12.060
keeps lingering in my mind.

05:13.540 --> 05:14.910
Every time I think of it,

05:16.060 --> 05:17.520
I make a painting.

05:18.770 --> 05:20.160
73 paintings.

05:22.470 --> 05:23.500
I thought

05:24.780 --> 05:26.570
I had truly fallen for him.

05:37.659 --> 05:38.470
My Lady!

05:39.659 --> 05:41.150
However many paintings I used
to think of him,

05:41.150 --> 05:43.150
I'll need just as many to forget him.

05:43.180 --> 05:44.360
If one isn't enough,

05:44.420 --> 05:45.880
then I'll tear up another!

05:46.830 --> 05:47.630
My Lady!

05:47.830 --> 05:48.630
My Lady!

05:48.909 --> 05:49.900
My Lady.

05:50.390 --> 05:51.180
These...

05:51.290 --> 05:53.409
These are all your hard work!

05:53.630 --> 05:54.950
Stop tearing them up.

05:55.100 --> 05:56.390
Please stop.

05:57.270 --> 05:59.340
He's just an ordinary man.

05:59.780 --> 06:01.030
What makes him any different

06:01.030 --> 06:02.400
from the others?

06:03.830 --> 06:07.020
I, Song Yiting, will never be
trapped by love.

06:07.510 --> 06:09.510
There are thousands of rivers
in this world,

06:09.510 --> 06:11.310
so why settle for just one ladle?

06:25.000 --> 06:26.430
[Seventh Prince's Mansion]

06:38.409 --> 06:40.670
He's had two bowls already this morning.

06:42.840 --> 06:45.000
Good appetite suggests good mood.

06:46.020 --> 06:47.630
If he's in such a good mood,

06:47.850 --> 06:49.530
could it be because of Yiting?

06:52.180 --> 06:53.490
This dish is too salty.

06:54.470 --> 06:56.630
Pickled vegetables are supposed
to be salty, okay?

06:56.630 --> 06:58.159
Being so picky,

06:58.420 --> 07:01.920
could it be he had a fight with Yiting?

07:05.340 --> 07:06.400
You're not eating?

07:06.960 --> 07:08.220
Is it not to your taste?

07:09.590 --> 07:10.420
Or is it because

07:10.420 --> 07:11.780
you fed me medicine yesterday,

07:11.780 --> 07:14.440
you're expecting me to feed you
today in return?

07:15.300 --> 07:16.630
I'd rather not,

07:16.660 --> 07:19.520
lest I soil Your Highness's clothes again.

07:24.390 --> 07:27.710
You've been in the palace for 10 days now
since Mother brought you in.

07:27.710 --> 07:29.390
Now that you've finally come out,

07:29.390 --> 07:30.850
why not visit your family?

07:30.860 --> 07:31.990
Don't you miss them?

07:33.510 --> 07:35.170
Trying to get rid of me so soon,

07:35.860 --> 07:38.909
can't wait to see Yiting, huh?

07:40.980 --> 07:42.270
What's with that face?

07:44.180 --> 07:45.870
I was just wondering

07:46.230 --> 07:47.230
why Your Highness

07:47.270 --> 07:49.600
suddenly started caring about my family.

07:51.340 --> 07:53.070
After we get married,

07:53.650 --> 07:54.650
your family

07:55.100 --> 07:56.700
will be my family too, right?

08:00.790 --> 08:02.140
I knew it,

08:02.300 --> 08:03.630
you're up to something.

08:06.870 --> 08:07.720
By the way,

08:08.080 --> 08:10.340
does your sister have someone she likes?

08:10.830 --> 08:12.450
I heard she's quite picky,

08:12.810 --> 08:14.720
and hasn't settled on an engagement yet.

08:14.720 --> 08:16.380
What kind of man does she like?

08:18.260 --> 08:20.740
You scumbag,

08:20.980 --> 08:22.640
already trying to make a move?

08:32.020 --> 08:33.419
Why did you slam the bowl?

08:34.230 --> 08:35.289
What's wrong?

08:39.900 --> 08:41.400
Well, Your Highness.

08:42.030 --> 08:45.370
I-I suddenly have a stomachache.

08:45.870 --> 08:47.530
You're having a stomachache?

08:48.590 --> 08:49.510
I can't take it anymore.

08:49.510 --> 08:50.990
My stomach hurts too much.

08:50.990 --> 08:51.850
Your Highness.

08:51.910 --> 08:53.750
Please enjoy your meal without me.

08:53.750 --> 08:54.950
I'll head back first.

08:58.150 --> 09:00.480
Get an imperial physician to check on you.

09:02.020 --> 09:03.230
Have you heard?

09:03.780 --> 09:07.110
Song Yimeng has moved into the
Seventh Prince's Residence.

09:08.330 --> 09:09.870
They haven't even gotten married yet,

09:09.870 --> 09:11.540
and she's already moved into
his residence.

09:11.540 --> 09:12.700
How inappropriate.

09:13.000 --> 09:13.920
That one

09:13.950 --> 09:15.420
always acts outrageously.

09:15.420 --> 09:17.680
When has she ever cared about propriety?

09:18.780 --> 09:20.010
I also heard that

09:20.030 --> 09:21.150
she once went to a pharmacy

09:21.150 --> 09:24.010
to buy that kind of medicine for
the Seventh Prince.

09:24.520 --> 09:25.820
Really?

09:25.910 --> 09:28.130
She really has no shame at all.

09:28.640 --> 09:29.950
Yiting. Yiting.

09:29.980 --> 09:31.710
You know the inside story best.

09:31.830 --> 09:32.830
Tell us,

09:32.860 --> 09:34.350
how far have they gotten?

09:37.270 --> 09:38.060
Yiting?

09:43.460 --> 09:44.480
Yiting.

09:45.780 --> 09:46.680
What's wrong?

09:47.590 --> 09:48.880
You seem distracted.

09:49.450 --> 09:51.010
Are you in a bad mood?

09:54.260 --> 09:56.140
You missed the gathering

09:56.230 --> 09:57.450
the other day as well.

09:57.910 --> 09:59.170
Did something happen?

10:00.660 --> 10:02.030
Are you feeling unwell?

10:02.660 --> 10:04.060
You're not sick, are you?

10:05.190 --> 10:06.480
I know!

10:07.420 --> 10:08.700
Not seeing me for days

10:08.990 --> 10:10.350
has made her lovesick.

10:11.010 --> 10:12.590
As for Miss Yiting's ailment,

10:12.590 --> 10:13.390
I

10:12.740 --> 10:15.070
[Bamboo Mist, Rippling Moon]

10:13.580 --> 10:15.160
understand it best.

10:15.870 --> 10:16.660
Your Highness.

10:16.660 --> 10:18.520
Please, no need for formalities.

10:21.760 --> 10:23.820
What brings you here, Your Highness?

10:29.400 --> 10:30.210
I'm here

10:30.350 --> 10:32.670
to court you, Miss Yiting.

10:33.210 --> 10:34.010
Yiting.

10:34.510 --> 10:36.900
His Highness is here for you.

10:36.930 --> 10:37.690
Yiting.

10:38.130 --> 10:39.460
As for the question you asked me before,

10:39.460 --> 10:40.770
I now have a new answer.

10:40.770 --> 10:41.650
I've come today

10:41.650 --> 10:43.250
to tell you in person.

10:44.740 --> 10:45.730
Your Highness.

10:45.730 --> 10:47.060
What answer do you have?

10:48.290 --> 10:49.470
I believe that

10:49.700 --> 10:52.010
marriages should be based on
mutual affection

10:52.010 --> 10:53.060
and natural attraction.

10:53.060 --> 10:55.010
Miss Yiting's talents and beauty

10:55.300 --> 10:56.700
are merely external qualities.

10:56.700 --> 10:58.220
What I truly love

10:58.820 --> 10:59.940
is your heart.

11:04.610 --> 11:06.210
Then tell me, Your Highness,

11:06.340 --> 11:07.420
in your eyes,

11:07.700 --> 11:09.940
what is my heart like?

11:11.610 --> 11:13.770
You refuse to be bound by
conventional etiquette

11:13.770 --> 11:16.240
or commit yourself carelessly
to marriage.

11:16.460 --> 11:18.300
You resent being controlled
by your parents,

11:18.300 --> 11:20.940
and wish to escape what others call fate.

11:21.060 --> 11:22.820
You reject others' advances

11:22.820 --> 11:23.420
because you feel that

11:23.420 --> 11:24.820
they only love your appearance,

11:24.820 --> 11:26.770
and no one has ever asked

11:27.610 --> 11:28.940
who you really are.

11:30.300 --> 11:31.800
But Yiting,

11:32.130 --> 11:33.660
I am different from others.

11:34.930 --> 11:36.530
The reason I like you

11:37.940 --> 11:39.600
is simply because you are you.

11:42.810 --> 11:44.610
If you love poetry and painting,

11:44.610 --> 11:45.750
I like you.

11:46.050 --> 11:47.530
If you love splendor and prosperity,

11:47.530 --> 11:48.420
I like you.

11:48.420 --> 11:49.730
Even if you're from

11:49.730 --> 11:50.370
every walk of life

11:50.370 --> 11:51.890
or a mere commoner,

11:52.890 --> 11:53.700
I still

11:54.650 --> 11:55.610
like you.

12:00.370 --> 12:01.180
Yiting.

12:02.370 --> 12:03.580
I want to marry you.

12:05.820 --> 12:07.180
From now on,

12:07.210 --> 12:08.670
I'll be the one to like you,

12:08.680 --> 12:09.570
and you

12:10.890 --> 12:12.770
just need to be yourself.

12:16.850 --> 12:18.650
His Highness is...

12:19.340 --> 12:20.490
Proposing to you?

12:21.410 --> 12:22.280
Yiting,

12:22.730 --> 12:23.730
isn't this

12:23.730 --> 12:26.130
exactly what you've always wanted to hear?

12:29.940 --> 12:31.100
Your Highness,

12:31.370 --> 12:32.530
please come with me.

12:47.010 --> 12:47.820
Tell me,

12:47.940 --> 12:49.300
who taught you to say that?

12:49.300 --> 12:50.180
No, I...

12:50.370 --> 12:51.490
No, I...

12:52.350 --> 12:53.370
No one taught him.

12:53.730 --> 12:56.260
Those were all His Highness's
sincere words.

12:57.100 --> 12:57.890
Yiting.

12:58.380 --> 13:00.250
I've liked you for so long after all,

13:00.250 --> 13:02.420
so I should've picked up some insights
by now, right?

13:02.420 --> 13:03.010
Besides,

13:03.010 --> 13:05.130
today I was just overcome with emotion,

13:05.130 --> 13:07.130
so I poured everything out at once.

13:07.130 --> 13:08.580
Seeing you doubt me like this,

13:08.580 --> 13:10.180
it kind of hurts my feelings.

13:10.180 --> 13:10.980
Really?

13:17.940 --> 13:18.770
I'm sorry.

13:19.250 --> 13:20.380
I was overthinking.

13:22.270 --> 13:23.070
It's alright.

13:37.180 --> 13:37.940
Yiting! Yiting!

13:37.940 --> 13:38.370
Don't. Don't!

13:38.370 --> 13:39.220
Wait, what are you doing?

13:39.220 --> 13:40.020
Yiting, stop!

13:41.100 --> 13:42.010
Wait, Yiting!

13:43.250 --> 13:44.060
Yiting.

13:44.090 --> 13:46.540
Can I... Can I still explain myself?

13:46.700 --> 13:47.490
Let go.

13:52.460 --> 13:53.610
It's over, Jixiang.

14:01.730 --> 14:02.990
I'm done for, Jixiang.

14:05.060 --> 14:06.010
It's all over.

14:11.100 --> 14:11.940
Liu Huaiyi.

14:12.060 --> 14:13.400
What do you mean by that?

14:13.820 --> 14:15.210
Am I wrong?

14:15.770 --> 14:16.900
Song Yiting

14:16.940 --> 14:19.270
clearly wants to be the prince's consort.

14:19.420 --> 14:21.320
But she has to play hard to get,

14:21.820 --> 14:24.820
making the Eighteenth Prince
beg for her attention.

14:25.010 --> 14:27.250
When it comes to playing hard to get
the way she does,

14:27.250 --> 14:29.280
no one else can compare.

14:29.610 --> 14:31.250
Yiting is not that kind of person.

14:31.250 --> 14:32.980
That's because she's good at pretending,

14:32.980 --> 14:35.300
acting all innocent and unworldly.

14:35.820 --> 14:38.490
But among all the unmarried ladies
in the capital,

14:38.490 --> 14:39.670
she's the one

14:40.010 --> 14:42.700
who knows best how to catch
men's attention.

14:42.840 --> 14:45.940
Why else would the Eighteenth Prince
notice her?

14:46.130 --> 14:47.170
Liu Huaiyi.

14:47.420 --> 14:48.700
Talking behind her back,

14:48.700 --> 14:50.060
what kind of friend are you?

14:50.060 --> 14:51.170
Alright, alright.

14:51.610 --> 14:52.530
Stop arguing.

14:53.250 --> 14:55.100
We've been friends for so many years.

14:55.100 --> 14:56.940
It's not worth ruining our friendship

14:56.940 --> 14:57.940
over something so trivial.

14:57.940 --> 14:59.940
We may consider Song Yiting our friend,

14:59.940 --> 15:01.770
but she might not feel the same way.

15:01.770 --> 15:02.940
All these years,

15:03.010 --> 15:04.840
she's been looking down on us.

15:04.940 --> 15:07.230
Has she ever truly respected any of us?

15:07.300 --> 15:08.560
I'll tear your mouth apart!

15:08.560 --> 15:09.080
You...

15:09.100 --> 15:09.700
Alright, calm down, Ruru.

15:09.700 --> 15:10.610
You're angry at me?

15:10.610 --> 15:12.530
You're the most pathetic one, Jia Ruru,

15:12.530 --> 15:14.530
following Song Yiting around all day

15:14.530 --> 15:15.770
like some echo,

15:15.770 --> 15:17.220
yet understanding nothing.

15:17.220 --> 15:18.300
This whole scene today

15:18.300 --> 15:20.900
was clearly planned by Song Yiting
in advance!

15:25.010 --> 15:26.870
All sweet and sisterly in public,

15:26.940 --> 15:28.750
but backstabbing in private.

15:29.060 --> 15:30.200
Miss Liu, you truly

15:30.370 --> 15:32.700
live up to your reputation as
a noble lady.

15:33.580 --> 15:34.370
Who is it?

15:34.940 --> 15:36.490
This is between us friends.

15:36.490 --> 15:37.940
Who are you to lecture me?

15:38.490 --> 15:39.700
Matters between friends

15:39.700 --> 15:41.980
are indeed not my place to comment on.

15:42.220 --> 15:43.420
However, I believe

15:43.610 --> 15:44.850
that in relationships,

15:44.850 --> 15:46.450
sincerity is most valuable.

15:46.850 --> 15:48.580
She prepared new clothes and new jewelry

15:48.580 --> 15:50.670
just for today's gathering.

15:50.770 --> 15:51.990
Even if you cannot repay this friendship

15:51.990 --> 15:54.210
in kind, you shouldn't treat

15:54.300 --> 15:56.700
sincere feelings like they're worthless.

15:58.260 --> 15:59.940
Now I get it.

16:00.100 --> 16:01.970
Just another one defending her.

16:02.060 --> 16:03.340
One's a prince,

16:03.730 --> 16:06.320
the other's a charlatan like you.

16:06.460 --> 16:08.320
Song Yiting really is something.

16:08.420 --> 16:10.650
There's no man she can't seduce.

16:18.730 --> 16:19.660
Are you alright?

16:20.530 --> 16:21.920
Who exactly are you?

16:22.650 --> 16:26.010
Just a stranger who couldn't stand by
and watch injustice.

16:26.100 --> 16:26.890
You...

16:26.890 --> 16:27.730
Well done!

16:27.730 --> 16:28.340
Beautifully done!

16:28.340 --> 16:29.690
Good job!

16:30.250 --> 16:31.060
Mister.

16:31.130 --> 16:32.490
Would you like to come in for some tea

16:32.490 --> 16:33.670
and rest for a while?

17:00.250 --> 17:01.980
Why did you come anyway, Mr. Li?

17:05.859 --> 17:06.940
Just passing by.

17:08.940 --> 17:11.170
Out of the entire wide capital,

17:11.290 --> 17:13.089
you just so happened to "pass by"
right here?

17:13.089 --> 17:14.619
If you were just passing by,

17:14.730 --> 17:15.900
why did you bother

17:15.900 --> 17:17.900
getting involved and defending me?

17:17.980 --> 17:19.569
After all, we've known each other
for some time,

17:19.569 --> 17:21.290
so it's only right that I
defend you a bit.

17:21.290 --> 17:22.900
Besides, it's really unfair of them

17:22.900 --> 17:25.010
to say such things about you
behind your back.

17:25.010 --> 17:27.410
I was talking about the Eighteenth Prince.

17:30.660 --> 17:32.770
Those things the Eighteenth Prince said,

17:32.770 --> 17:34.900
you taught him to say them, didn't you?

17:37.900 --> 17:39.780
You clearly know me well,

17:39.940 --> 17:41.460
yet you deliberately anger me

17:41.460 --> 17:42.650
and push me away.

17:42.770 --> 17:43.730
Why?

17:45.330 --> 17:47.450
Knowing you and liking you

17:47.570 --> 17:48.970
are two separate things.

17:49.530 --> 17:51.350
You're the most special

17:51.490 --> 17:53.100
and wonderful girl I've ever met.

17:53.100 --> 17:54.570
Even if I don't have feelings for you,

17:54.570 --> 17:56.060
you still deserve to be appreciated

17:56.060 --> 17:57.050
and treated well.

17:57.050 --> 17:57.940
You're lying.

17:58.980 --> 18:00.280
You just said

18:00.460 --> 18:01.460
that in relationships,

18:01.460 --> 18:02.980
sincerity is most valuable.

18:02.980 --> 18:03.980
Then, Li Shiliu,

18:04.010 --> 18:05.530
please honestly tell me,

18:06.290 --> 18:09.050
have you ever had feelings for me?

18:12.810 --> 18:14.560
If even half a word is a lie,

18:14.660 --> 18:15.660
may heaven strike you down.

18:15.660 --> 18:16.380
I,

18:21.090 --> 18:22.240
Li Shiliu,

18:22.900 --> 18:24.700
have never had feelings for you.

18:25.520 --> 18:26.790
Say it again.

18:26.810 --> 18:28.900
No matter how many times I say it,
it won't change.

18:28.900 --> 18:29.930
Li Shiliu

18:30.050 --> 18:31.220
has never had feelings for you.

18:31.220 --> 18:33.380
So you pushed me toward the
Eighteenth Prince,

18:33.380 --> 18:35.180
taking advantage of when you discarded me

18:35.180 --> 18:36.760
to let him approach me?

18:37.700 --> 18:38.980
You've misjudged me.

18:39.090 --> 18:42.150
I, Song Yiting, am not someone
who can't accept defeat.

18:42.490 --> 18:44.380
I just felt that I hurt you,

18:44.380 --> 18:45.940
and if there could be someone who
truly cared for you

18:45.940 --> 18:46.700
by your side,

18:46.700 --> 18:47.660
you might feel better.

18:47.660 --> 18:49.140
Stop deceiving yourself.

18:49.420 --> 18:51.950
You just wanted to make yourself
feel better.

18:52.330 --> 18:54.090
In your eyes, I'm nothing more than

18:54.090 --> 18:55.690
a piece of clothing

18:55.810 --> 18:57.010
or a piece of jewelry.

18:57.700 --> 18:59.350
But even if you don't like me,

18:59.460 --> 19:02.010
what right do you have to push me
onto someone else?

19:02.010 --> 19:03.770
I never thought of you that way.

19:04.140 --> 19:04.980
Li Shiliu.

19:05.860 --> 19:07.390
You love to lecture others,

19:07.700 --> 19:08.990
but you're not worthy.

19:09.860 --> 19:11.170
You teach others that

19:11.290 --> 19:12.460
marriages are about mutual affection and

19:12.460 --> 19:13.660
natural attraction,

19:14.490 --> 19:17.490
but you yourself don't understand
what love is at all.

19:18.530 --> 19:19.660
You tell others

19:20.140 --> 19:21.940
not to disregard true feelings,

19:22.660 --> 19:24.420
yet you have no heart at all.

19:27.290 --> 19:28.730
I used to like you

19:29.570 --> 19:32.370
because I thought you were different
from others.

19:32.620 --> 19:33.530
But from now on,

19:34.180 --> 19:35.750
I won't like you anymore,

19:37.140 --> 19:38.570
because I despise you

19:39.420 --> 19:40.950
even more than anyone else.

19:44.770 --> 19:45.570
I'm sorry.

19:48.250 --> 19:49.050
Don't bother.

19:50.250 --> 19:51.480
Tomorrow at noon,

19:51.730 --> 19:53.730
at Zijin Pavilion outside the city,

19:54.090 --> 19:55.820
I'll return what you asked for.

19:56.700 --> 19:57.630
Please kindly

19:58.060 --> 20:00.060
bring back my paintings too, Mr. Li.

20:00.660 --> 20:02.120
Don't soil my belongings.

20:11.570 --> 20:12.630
She... He... He...

20:12.630 --> 20:13.650
They...

20:14.570 --> 20:16.370
They're a real couple?

20:17.680 --> 20:18.740
What about me?

20:19.180 --> 20:20.350
What am I to her?

20:22.020 --> 20:23.810
Probably just a laughingstock
who copied Mr. Li's love lines

20:23.810 --> 20:25.540
yet failed in your confession.

20:26.380 --> 20:27.490
Nonsense!

20:27.570 --> 20:28.770
It must be that Li Shiliu.

20:28.770 --> 20:30.440
He... He must have deliberately
played me,

20:30.440 --> 20:31.850
making me look foolish in front of Yiting

20:31.850 --> 20:33.580
and paving the way for himself.

20:34.010 --> 20:35.570
I'm the auspicious sign of the Great Jing.

20:35.570 --> 20:37.500
How could I be treated so unjustly?

20:38.310 --> 20:39.270
Just you wait.

20:39.300 --> 20:40.780
I must prove to Yiting

20:40.800 --> 20:41.500
that Li Shiliu,

20:41.500 --> 20:43.760
he... He's not such a good person either.

20:46.180 --> 20:46.980
Either?

20:49.070 --> 20:50.140
Did I say "either"?

20:50.760 --> 20:53.060
[Gentle Breeze]

21:03.720 --> 21:04.520
Father?

21:05.540 --> 21:08.280
[Song Residence]

21:27.630 --> 21:28.510
Madam...

21:33.730 --> 21:35.400
You'd better explain to me

21:35.530 --> 21:37.180
what this is about.

21:37.820 --> 21:39.150
Whose portrait is this?

21:41.220 --> 21:42.830
What do you mean by that?

21:43.010 --> 21:44.670
What happened to Song Yiting?

21:45.330 --> 21:46.370
Yimeng,

21:47.490 --> 21:48.750
there are some matters

21:49.330 --> 21:51.620
I shouldn't have troubled you with,

21:51.770 --> 21:53.570
but I don't know what's gotten
into Yiting lately.

21:53.570 --> 21:55.380
Maybe it's because she's fallen
for someone,

21:55.380 --> 21:56.460
she wouldn't listen to her mother

21:56.460 --> 21:58.660
about marrying the Eighteenth Prince,

21:59.010 --> 22:01.590
and the whole family is in chaos
because of this.

22:01.590 --> 22:02.620
Oh no.

22:03.570 --> 22:05.700
She's already fallen in love with him.

22:07.530 --> 22:08.730
Father, don't worry.

22:09.110 --> 22:10.240
I'll see this matter

22:10.660 --> 22:11.900
through to the end.

22:15.330 --> 22:16.140
Chief.

22:16.490 --> 22:17.630
Miss Song is here.

22:21.420 --> 22:23.160
What brings you here today?

22:25.170 --> 22:25.960
Mr. Li.

22:25.980 --> 22:27.980
You really need to help me this time.

22:28.140 --> 22:29.450
Please.

22:33.300 --> 22:34.450
Spit it out!

22:35.180 --> 22:36.670
Who exactly is that man?

22:37.050 --> 22:37.860
I...

22:37.980 --> 22:40.750
I really don't know.

22:41.800 --> 22:42.560
Fine.

22:43.140 --> 22:44.400
If she refuses to talk,

22:44.490 --> 22:45.460
I won't keep

22:45.620 --> 22:46.810
this wretched life of hers!

22:46.810 --> 22:47.620
Beat her!

22:51.980 --> 22:52.980
Stop beating her!

22:54.180 --> 22:55.320
Stop it!

22:55.350 --> 22:56.390
My Lady.

22:57.150 --> 22:58.310
Stop this at once!

23:02.570 --> 23:03.330
Mother!

23:03.330 --> 23:04.490
What are you doing?

23:05.490 --> 23:06.960
You're asking me?

23:07.180 --> 23:09.440
I should be asking you what you're doing!

23:09.770 --> 23:10.900
I heard from the doorman

23:10.900 --> 23:12.010
that you've been calling for carriages
every day

23:12.010 --> 23:14.080
just to meet a man in secret!

23:14.100 --> 23:15.250
Did I raise you

23:15.280 --> 23:16.860
just so you could degrade yourself

23:16.860 --> 23:18.750
by associating with some scum?

23:19.460 --> 23:21.330
My relationship with him is proper
and respectful.

23:21.330 --> 23:23.380
And he's not some scum you make
him out to be!

23:23.380 --> 23:24.780
Proper relationship?

23:26.090 --> 23:27.140
How dare you say

23:27.140 --> 23:28.860
something so improper!

23:28.980 --> 23:30.640
Are you trying to anger me to death?

23:30.640 --> 23:32.640
So what do you call proper behavior?

23:32.770 --> 23:34.090
Dressing myself up

23:34.090 --> 23:35.530
to parade before sons of noble families,

23:35.530 --> 23:36.620
is that proper behavior?

23:36.620 --> 23:38.330
If it were the Eighteenth Prince today,

23:38.330 --> 23:39.490
forget about secret meetings,

23:39.490 --> 23:40.900
even if I had an improper affair with him,

23:40.900 --> 23:42.570
you'd still thank our ancestors
for the blessing

23:42.570 --> 23:45.170
and wish everyone in the capital
knew about it!

23:47.420 --> 23:49.290
Are you trying to anger me to death?

23:49.290 --> 23:50.420
You should know that

23:50.530 --> 23:52.940
if this ever gets out,

23:52.940 --> 23:54.120
your reputation

23:54.220 --> 23:55.750
will be completely ruined!

23:57.900 --> 23:59.560
Reputation is like a shackle,

23:59.700 --> 24:02.630
which deserves to be discarded
like tattered shoes.

24:03.250 --> 24:04.270
Shannai,

24:04.380 --> 24:05.180
let's go.

24:08.220 --> 24:08.980
Impossible.

24:08.980 --> 24:10.220
That's impossible.

24:11.490 --> 24:12.590
I know

24:12.770 --> 24:14.980
it sounds ridiculous.

24:15.090 --> 24:15.810
But last time

24:15.810 --> 24:17.090
when I predicted the fire,

24:17.090 --> 24:18.380
didn't it happen as I said?

24:18.380 --> 24:21.640
Right now, Nan Heng is really
planning to kill Song Yiting.

24:22.290 --> 24:23.290
Mr. Li.

24:23.420 --> 24:24.610
I really need you to help me.

24:24.610 --> 24:26.610
Otherwise, Yiting will be done for.

24:26.940 --> 24:28.730
Everything needs evidence.

24:29.860 --> 24:30.860
As far as I know,

24:30.880 --> 24:34.210
between Nan Heng and Song Yiting,
there's absolutely no...

24:38.460 --> 24:39.250
Anyway,

24:40.050 --> 24:41.910
this must be a misunderstanding.

24:43.090 --> 24:44.300
How could it be?

24:44.320 --> 24:45.720
When it comes to romance,

24:45.750 --> 24:47.060
do you think you know
more than I do?

24:47.060 --> 24:47.700
I...

24:50.700 --> 24:51.620
Mr. Li.

24:51.660 --> 24:53.330
Let's not argue about this right now,

24:53.330 --> 24:53.940
okay?

24:53.940 --> 24:55.140
I can tell at a glance

24:55.140 --> 24:56.160
if a man has ulterior motives

24:56.160 --> 24:57.440
toward a woman.

24:57.510 --> 24:58.860
For example, from the way Nan Heng
looks at Yiting,

24:58.860 --> 25:00.280
it's obvious he's up to no good.

25:00.280 --> 25:01.340
But the way you look at me

25:01.340 --> 25:03.100
is merely friendly, Mr. Li.

25:08.380 --> 25:09.180
You...

25:10.290 --> 25:11.090
You...

25:12.460 --> 25:14.290
What are you doing?

25:16.190 --> 25:18.350
Do you believe that I like women now?

25:20.330 --> 25:21.530
So,

25:22.490 --> 25:23.730
you were

25:24.050 --> 25:25.250
kissing me just now?

25:27.490 --> 25:29.020
You still don't believe me?

25:43.140 --> 25:49.700
♪ Look at the sky, flowers bloom
and fragrance fills the air ♪

25:51.210 --> 25:57.770
♪ The sound of heartbeats
resonates in the passing time ♪

25:58.620 --> 26:05.490
♪ Look at the way you're going,
destiny has it all planned out ♪

26:06.710 --> 26:16.530
♪ We lead remarkable lives
in this mundane world ♪

26:13.530 --> 26:14.730
Do you believe me now?

26:16.570 --> 26:17.630
So, I don't want

26:17.940 --> 26:19.270
to hear any more of that talk

26:19.270 --> 26:21.530
about us being friends
from you anymore.

26:22.770 --> 26:23.800
Didn't you say

26:24.090 --> 26:26.350
you understand romance better than I do?

26:27.460 --> 26:28.420
Then tell me,

26:28.460 --> 26:29.620
what does this

26:30.330 --> 26:31.140
make us?

26:35.920 --> 26:36.730
Well...

26:40.730 --> 26:41.780
I think...

26:56.980 --> 26:58.510
What we have between us isn't friendship.

26:58.510 --> 27:00.270
It's not friendship.

27:03.380 --> 27:04.270
But who

27:05.030 --> 27:07.350
kisses with a mask on?

27:10.830 --> 27:12.770
Chief really went for it.

27:12.940 --> 27:14.500
He actually kissed her.

27:14.570 --> 27:17.300
Let's see if he dares to kiss her
without the mask.

27:36.900 --> 27:37.700
What's wrong?

27:38.420 --> 27:40.080
Drowning your sorrows alone?

27:43.660 --> 27:44.900
Shanhu has filled me in

27:44.900 --> 27:47.300
on what's been going on
these past few days.

27:48.570 --> 27:49.380
What?

27:49.980 --> 27:52.640
You want to blame me for
messing things up again?

27:53.460 --> 27:54.250
Go ahead.

27:58.660 --> 27:59.590
You fell in love?

28:09.570 --> 28:11.410
Just days ago, I was teasing you

28:11.900 --> 28:14.810
about how Song Yimeng had you
completely smitten.

28:15.560 --> 28:17.360
Look how the tables have turned.

28:17.770 --> 28:19.170
It's only been a few days,

28:19.810 --> 28:21.460
and now you're the audience,

28:21.610 --> 28:22.640
while I've become

28:23.290 --> 28:24.460
the performer.

28:26.490 --> 28:27.740
Your little drama

28:27.770 --> 28:29.970
isn't worth my time and effort to watch.

28:31.530 --> 28:32.620
But the question is,

28:32.620 --> 28:34.010
if you like her,

28:34.040 --> 28:35.390
why don't you go win her back?

28:35.390 --> 28:36.650
Why sit here brooding?

28:37.470 --> 28:38.380
And then what?

28:38.950 --> 28:40.810
Live happily ever after with her?

28:41.100 --> 28:43.090
Or one day when my identity is exposed,

28:43.090 --> 28:44.400
I'll drag the entire Waning River Crescent

28:44.400 --> 28:46.160
and her into this mess?

28:47.620 --> 28:49.790
Don't overestimate yourself, okay?

28:49.810 --> 28:52.610
As if my Waning River Crescent
needs your concern.

28:55.980 --> 28:56.780
You're right.

28:57.900 --> 29:00.300
I have no right to think so
highly of myself.

29:00.660 --> 29:02.060
I haven't forgotten that

29:02.550 --> 29:03.590
you and I

29:03.930 --> 29:05.800
are also just part of a deal.

29:08.670 --> 29:09.470
That's true.

29:15.330 --> 29:17.590
Do you remember who I was three years ago?

29:21.760 --> 29:22.910
Three years ago,

29:24.010 --> 29:26.940
you were a famous hero in Jiangnan,
Shangguan Baihe,

29:26.950 --> 29:28.880
known as Mr. Shangguan.

29:29.400 --> 29:30.380
Within half a month,

29:30.380 --> 29:32.710
you committed more than 10 major thefts.

29:32.900 --> 29:35.100
I led 2,000 Xuanjia Army soldiers,

29:35.180 --> 29:37.740
mobilizing forces from three provinces
and six cities,

29:37.740 --> 29:39.400
yet still failed to catch you.

29:40.490 --> 29:41.330
But later,

29:41.330 --> 29:42.980
you were exposed because

29:43.180 --> 29:44.700
a friend betrayed you.

29:46.860 --> 29:49.090
Back then, I, Baihe, trusted
the wrong person

29:49.090 --> 29:50.330
and fell into a trap,

29:50.950 --> 29:52.230
with no way out.

29:52.860 --> 29:54.470
In the end, I had no choice but to

29:54.470 --> 29:55.950
break my wings to survive.

30:00.630 --> 30:01.910
Are you blaming me,

30:02.570 --> 30:04.090
for clipping your wings

30:04.340 --> 30:07.380
and trapping you in this small
Waning River Crescent?

30:09.220 --> 30:09.810
Yes.

30:11.180 --> 30:13.210
I hate you, the mighty Seventh Prince,
to the core

30:13.210 --> 30:14.770
for not letting me die.

30:17.440 --> 30:21.120
[Three years ago]

30:19.940 --> 30:22.400
The Ministry of Justice has issued
their verdict.

30:22.400 --> 30:25.060
You've been sentenced to
immediate execution,

30:26.480 --> 30:28.480
which will be carried out tomorrow.

30:29.600 --> 30:30.800
It's been seven days.

30:31.330 --> 30:32.790
You come every single day.

30:33.980 --> 30:36.740
Could you give a dying man
one day of peace?

30:38.580 --> 30:40.160
If I were you,

30:40.530 --> 30:43.090
I'd try my best to find a way
out of here alive

30:43.500 --> 30:45.180
to see what color blood runs in someone

30:45.180 --> 30:47.340
who would betray their companion

30:47.700 --> 30:49.030
for 2,000 taels of gold.

30:54.140 --> 30:56.960
The person you speak of
who betrayed their companion

30:56.960 --> 30:58.010
is both an enemy

30:58.900 --> 31:00.200
and a friend to me.

31:02.010 --> 31:03.720
Your enemy framed you,

31:04.110 --> 31:04.920
betrayed you,

31:04.940 --> 31:06.660
and kept all the riches for himself,

31:06.660 --> 31:08.750
yet you still consider him a friend.

31:09.050 --> 31:10.780
It seems you deserve your fate.

31:13.520 --> 31:15.240
Someone like you,

31:16.250 --> 31:17.450
born into privilege,

31:18.480 --> 31:21.250
could never understand what kind of life

31:22.980 --> 31:24.770
he and I lived before.

31:25.810 --> 31:27.140
Wrapped in horsehide upon death,

31:27.140 --> 31:28.940
licking blood from blade edges,

31:28.980 --> 31:30.940
and entrusting your back to comrades.

31:30.940 --> 31:33.140
This prince believes the past you speak of

31:33.140 --> 31:34.930
wasn't much harder than this.

31:35.180 --> 31:36.040
"This prince"?

31:37.700 --> 31:38.620
Who are you?

31:39.660 --> 31:41.010
Who I am doesn't matter.

31:41.580 --> 31:42.550
What matters is

31:42.730 --> 31:43.860
you're still alive.

31:44.330 --> 31:45.660
As long as we're alive,

31:46.160 --> 31:48.790
we should cherish every single day.

31:48.860 --> 31:50.580
Friends gone? So be it.

31:50.600 --> 31:52.660
Path blocked? Carve through mountains.

31:52.660 --> 31:54.470
But if your life is gone,

31:54.860 --> 31:57.270
that's truly the end.

32:10.050 --> 32:11.450
Here's to shady friends.

32:13.190 --> 32:13.910
Alright.

32:13.930 --> 32:15.530
To disreputable companion.

32:22.140 --> 32:23.600
Heart like wood and stone,

32:23.860 --> 32:25.460
utterly cold and unfeeling.

32:26.860 --> 32:28.860
You're not speaking from the heart.

32:29.740 --> 32:30.820
However, I never expected

32:30.820 --> 32:32.490
you'd be troubled by love.

32:32.520 --> 32:34.430
Like master, like man.

32:34.610 --> 32:35.960
When it comes to being troubled by love,

32:35.960 --> 32:37.960
you, Chief, are the true expert.

32:38.180 --> 32:40.110
I can't hold a candle to you on that.

32:42.620 --> 32:43.910
But the point is,

32:43.960 --> 32:45.420
I never pushed the person I love

32:45.420 --> 32:46.880
into someone else's arms.

32:47.090 --> 32:47.920
Besides,

32:47.940 --> 32:50.120
the lady doesn't even like Nan Rui,

32:50.140 --> 32:52.270
yet you think you're doing her a favor.

32:56.220 --> 32:57.700
That blabbermouth Shanhu,

32:57.700 --> 32:59.060
telling everything.

33:00.330 --> 33:01.940
What does this have to do with Shanhu?

33:01.940 --> 33:03.740
You have only yourself to blame.

33:03.770 --> 33:06.380
You not only messed it up,

33:06.380 --> 33:08.380
but you also broke the lady's heart.

33:18.640 --> 33:19.890
I was a prisoner

33:20.050 --> 33:21.940
who should have died long ago.

33:23.330 --> 33:26.490
There's no way I could fall in love with
a lady from a noble family.

33:26.490 --> 33:27.560
Chief,

33:28.530 --> 33:29.980
don't you understand?

33:30.700 --> 33:32.960
It doesn't matter whether I understand.

33:32.970 --> 33:34.210
What matters is,

33:34.240 --> 33:35.920
does Song Yiting understand?

33:35.940 --> 33:37.630
Whether she understands or not
doesn't matter,

33:37.630 --> 33:39.810
because the person she likes
isn't the real me.

33:39.810 --> 33:41.110
Then tell her

33:41.130 --> 33:43.460
what you're really like beneath the mask.

33:43.490 --> 33:44.750
So, if Song Yimeng knew

33:44.760 --> 33:46.380
what you're really like beneath that mask,

33:46.380 --> 33:47.440
how would she feel?

33:47.620 --> 33:48.070
I...

33:51.330 --> 33:52.010
See?

33:57.940 --> 33:59.380
This Li Shiliu's outfit

33:59.910 --> 34:02.170
has really caused quite a bit of trouble.

34:02.270 --> 34:04.130
All the frustration in your heart

34:04.360 --> 34:06.040
stems from Song Yiting.

34:06.400 --> 34:08.199
Why not just ask her out

34:08.460 --> 34:09.540
and tell her

34:09.560 --> 34:11.170
everything that's on your mind?

34:11.170 --> 34:11.940
This way,

34:12.150 --> 34:14.409
you won't have any regrets in the future.

34:19.989 --> 34:21.389
What if I don't want to go?

34:24.380 --> 34:25.550
If you don't go,

34:26.340 --> 34:27.949
then the crane in your heart

34:27.969 --> 34:29.790
will remain trapped in your mental prison,

34:29.790 --> 34:32.389
and you'll be left with nothing
but your title.

34:45.340 --> 34:46.460
Tomorrow at noon,

34:46.900 --> 34:48.130
let me borrow

34:48.590 --> 34:50.449
Li Shiliu's outfit one more time.

34:51.730 --> 34:52.920
That's more like it.

34:54.050 --> 34:54.860
Here.

34:55.420 --> 34:56.480
Tomorrow,

34:56.860 --> 34:58.670
bring both the Qianyu Moon-Cleaving Blade

34:58.670 --> 35:00.170
and yourself with your heart intact

35:00.170 --> 35:01.650
back to me.

35:01.780 --> 35:02.640
Understand?

35:05.300 --> 35:06.090
Come on.

35:07.460 --> 35:08.590
Success awaits you.

35:09.540 --> 35:12.600
[Xiyue Pavilion]

35:11.900 --> 35:12.690
My Lady.

35:13.090 --> 35:14.090
I'm sorry.

35:15.260 --> 35:17.250
It's all my fault for being careless

35:17.250 --> 35:19.020
and letting Madam find out.

35:21.080 --> 35:22.610
It doesn't matter anymore.

35:23.370 --> 35:26.410
He wouldn't be with me anyway.

35:28.510 --> 35:30.440
He'd rather push me to someone else

35:30.630 --> 35:32.490
than admit he has feelings for me.

35:33.260 --> 35:34.300
In his eyes,

35:34.750 --> 35:35.830
I'm nothing.

35:36.780 --> 35:38.740
If you see it so clearly,

35:38.770 --> 35:40.770
why do you still have to love him?

35:43.690 --> 35:45.410
I know exactly what I'm doing.

35:45.490 --> 35:47.490
I don't need others preaching to me.

35:48.380 --> 35:50.980
If you're here as our parents' messenger,

35:50.980 --> 35:51.900
please leave.

35:53.610 --> 35:54.460
Song Yiting,

35:55.050 --> 35:57.050
you've always been so strong-willed.

35:57.050 --> 35:59.380
Why would you fall for someone like him?

35:59.570 --> 36:01.340
Don't you know what kind of person he is?

36:01.340 --> 36:02.460
Deep and calculating,

36:02.460 --> 36:03.770
and secretive in his actions.

36:03.770 --> 36:05.780
Do you know how many dirty secrets

36:05.780 --> 36:06.650
he's hiding?

36:09.300 --> 36:10.490
Yes, he's deep and calculating,

36:10.490 --> 36:11.940
and secretive in his actions,

36:11.940 --> 36:13.380
but if he hadn't experienced

36:13.380 --> 36:14.740
all the hardships of life in his
early years

36:14.740 --> 36:15.900
and struggled to survive,

36:15.900 --> 36:17.230
why would he be this way?

36:19.490 --> 36:20.300
Fine.

36:20.740 --> 36:22.070
You can ignore all that,

36:22.740 --> 36:24.130
but do you know he's approaching you

36:24.130 --> 36:25.630
with ulterior motives?

36:26.380 --> 36:27.460
Of course I know.

36:28.170 --> 36:30.210
If it weren't for what he wants,

36:30.380 --> 36:32.470
he wouldn't agree to meet me.

36:32.690 --> 36:33.630
You know all this

36:33.660 --> 36:35.860
and still let him take advantage of you?

36:37.570 --> 36:38.980
A blade in hand

36:39.090 --> 36:40.170
can either kill

36:40.490 --> 36:41.570
or save the world.

36:42.980 --> 36:44.540
I trust my judgment.

36:44.750 --> 36:46.210
I won't be wrong about him.

36:46.460 --> 36:48.420
What're you talking about,
saving the world?

36:48.420 --> 36:50.040
Don't be fooled by his twisted logic

36:50.040 --> 36:51.050
and false words.

36:51.050 --> 36:52.390
Beneath his mask,

36:52.420 --> 36:54.500
he's nothing but a complete villain.

36:54.740 --> 36:57.070
But who's not wearing a mask
in this world?

36:57.860 --> 36:59.070
In the capital,

36:59.340 --> 37:00.570
who's not scheming

37:00.600 --> 37:02.260
and chasing fame and fortune?

37:02.340 --> 37:03.420
And who

37:03.420 --> 37:04.620
would ever show

37:04.650 --> 37:06.140
their true self to others?

37:07.570 --> 37:08.820
It's actually him

37:09.380 --> 37:11.260
who lives freely and authentically,

37:11.260 --> 37:12.630
without restraint.

37:16.690 --> 37:18.550
I really can't get through to you.

37:18.940 --> 37:20.060
Please, I'm begging you,

37:20.060 --> 37:20.930
alright?

37:21.040 --> 37:22.690
Don't get involved with him.

37:23.740 --> 37:25.170
In this world,

37:25.340 --> 37:27.170
you can fall for anyone,

37:27.190 --> 37:28.750
anyone but him.

37:30.220 --> 37:31.820
Why not him?

37:32.060 --> 37:33.850
Just because he's not
the Eighteenth Prince,

37:33.850 --> 37:35.580
he doesn't deserve to be loved?

37:36.000 --> 37:37.630
That's not what I meant.

37:37.780 --> 37:39.460
Then why are you trying to dissuade me?

37:39.460 --> 37:40.800
And what gives you the right

37:40.800 --> 37:42.130
to interfere in my life?

37:47.260 --> 37:48.370
Song Yiting.

37:48.740 --> 37:50.320
I really don't know

37:51.380 --> 37:54.050
how to explain this to you.

37:54.490 --> 37:55.980
But please believe me,

37:56.260 --> 37:57.770
being with him

37:57.860 --> 37:59.520
will really put you in danger.

38:00.980 --> 38:01.950
I'm going to bed.

38:01.970 --> 38:02.970
You should leave.

38:04.420 --> 38:05.170
Song Yiting!

38:06.260 --> 38:07.460
You'll die!

38:12.170 --> 38:12.980
Guihong!

38:14.940 --> 38:15.740
Guihong!

38:16.120 --> 38:16.930
Guihong.

38:17.260 --> 38:17.790
Guihong.

38:18.060 --> 38:19.300
Something terrible has happened.

38:19.300 --> 38:20.490
It's a disaster!

38:20.740 --> 38:21.690
Your Highness, please calm down.

38:21.690 --> 38:22.090
Take your time and tell me slowly.

38:22.090 --> 38:22.780
Listen,

38:23.210 --> 38:23.980
yesterday, I saw

38:23.980 --> 38:25.130
Yiting and Li Shiliu

38:25.130 --> 38:26.090
together,

38:26.090 --> 38:28.010
and they seemed quite close.

38:28.010 --> 38:28.820
So I immediately

38:28.820 --> 38:30.090
had someone investigate

38:30.090 --> 38:31.610
this mysterious Li Shiliu.

38:31.610 --> 38:33.260
I've already investigated him.

38:33.260 --> 38:33.980
His background is clean,

38:33.980 --> 38:34.980
with nothing suspicious.

38:34.980 --> 38:35.420
Yes,

38:35.420 --> 38:36.940
that's what I just found out.

38:36.940 --> 38:38.050
But I wasn't convinced,

38:38.050 --> 38:40.050
so I looked into the people around him,

38:40.050 --> 38:41.310
and guess what I found?

38:43.570 --> 38:44.380
He...

38:46.090 --> 38:46.900
Come here.

38:47.170 --> 38:47.650
Listen,

38:49.190 --> 38:51.790
there's someone called Shangguan He
with him,

38:51.820 --> 38:54.820
who's a death-row prisoner that
escaped from prison!

39:11.900 --> 39:13.030
Search thoroughly!

39:13.050 --> 39:13.740
Yes!

39:14.150 --> 39:14.960
Search!

39:14.980 --> 39:15.690
Yes!

39:16.170 --> 39:17.220
Who dares!

39:41.090 --> 39:42.530
General Chu, you're certainly

39:42.530 --> 39:44.130
in a fiery mood this morning.

39:45.170 --> 39:47.370
Bringing the Qianyu Army here with you,

39:47.530 --> 39:49.060
what are you planning to do?

39:50.490 --> 39:53.260
I'm not here to trouble you today,

39:56.010 --> 39:57.530
but for him.

39:59.790 --> 40:01.020
May I ask, Mr. Chu,

40:01.040 --> 40:02.900
what business do you have with me?

40:03.940 --> 40:05.310
Three years ago,

40:05.420 --> 40:06.680
in Jiangnan Province,

40:07.020 --> 40:08.230
Mr. Shangguan

40:08.470 --> 40:09.980
was accused of a serious crime

40:09.980 --> 40:11.640
and faked his death to escape.

40:12.270 --> 40:13.810
Do I need to say more?

40:15.230 --> 40:16.020
Rong Hua.

40:16.610 --> 40:17.420
Wait!

40:18.490 --> 40:22.170
Though we at Waning River Crescent are
just nobodies from the martial arts world,

40:22.170 --> 40:24.010
you can't just take someone away

40:24.010 --> 40:25.260
with a few words.

40:25.570 --> 40:26.380
Li Shiliu.

40:27.090 --> 40:28.530
I'm here on official business on behalf of
the capital prefecture's office.

40:28.530 --> 40:30.050
How dare you obstruct me?

40:30.050 --> 40:32.780
So what if it's the
capital prefecture's office?

40:33.290 --> 40:34.770
Unless I give the word,

40:35.610 --> 40:37.010
you're not taking anyone away.

40:37.010 --> 40:39.300
What if I insist on taking him away?

40:45.610 --> 40:47.490
You're welcome to try.

40:50.110 --> 40:51.620
[Big Fortune]
